14	 * once the owner has been saved. The event carries a monotonically increasing {@code seq}
15	 * across creates, the owner id, its membership level and its current primary identifier
16	 * (the customerCode today; whatever unifies it later, e.g. the memberId). Keeping the
17	 * identifier read in {@link #identifier(Owner)} means only that one line moves when the
18	 * primary identifier changes.
